  "graph": {
   "file": "voice/graph.wav",
   "duration": 23.55,
   "lead": 0.3,
   "chunks": [
    {
     "text": "Each sentence links to its passage, and the fact that passage states.",
     "start": 0.3,
     "end": 4.86
    },
    {
     "text": "When a newer source replaces that fact, the graph records an edge.",
     "start": 5.15,
     "end": 9.35
    },
    {
     "text": "So still true is a path:",
     "start": 9.635,
     "end": 12.075
    },
    {
     "text": "follow SUPERSEDED_BY to whatever holds today.",
     "start": 12.185,
     "end": 15.665
    },
    {
     "text": "FalkorDB runs that check on every sentence.",
     "start": 16.055,
     "end": 19.468
    },
    {
     "text": "The model writes the words. The graph decides what is current.",
     "start": 19.697,
     "end": 23.43
